<title>USA: IBM waiting period for Edmark expires.</title>
<headline>IBM waiting period for Edmark expires.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp said on Monday that the Hart-Scott-Rodino waiting period relating to IBM's proposed acquisition of Edmark Corp has expired.</p>
<p>IBM's tender offer for Edmark currently is scheduled to expire on December 16, the company said.</p>
<p>In November, IBM and Edmark said they agreed for IBM to acquire the education software maker for about $80 million in cash, or $15.50 a share.</p>
